1
00:01:23,280 --> 00:01:25,960
This is freshly made
homemade buffalo milk yogurt.

2
00:01:26,560 --> 00:01:30,040
That's right. Try some.
If you like it, you can buy some.

3
00:01:30,120 --> 00:01:31,760
-Sure.
-It's 35 baht a cup.

4
00:01:31,840 --> 00:01:34,200
Or three cups for 100 baht.

5
00:01:34,280 --> 00:01:36,800
We also have fruit yogurt
for 40 baht a cup.

6
00:01:36,880 --> 00:01:37,720
TEN BAHT EACH

7
00:01:37,800 --> 00:01:39,760
-Hey, this is pretty good.
-Right?

8
00:01:39,840 --> 00:01:41,360
Is this really made with buffalo milk?

9
00:01:41,440 --> 00:01:42,840
Of course.

10
00:01:42,920 --> 00:01:46,000
If you like something sweeter,
try the fruit yogurt.

11
00:01:52,400 --> 00:01:53,240
This one's good too.

12
00:01:54,280 --> 00:01:58,880
I'll take three original
and two fruit yogurts.

13
00:01:58,960 --> 00:02:00,680
-Sure.
-Coming right up. Just a moment.

14
00:02:00,760 --> 00:02:01,600
Okay.

15
00:02:02,120 --> 00:02:05,120
Three original and two fruit yogurts.

16
00:02:06,960 --> 00:02:08,160
-Oh, hello!
-Here you go.

17
00:02:08,240 --> 00:02:10,000
-Hi.
-Back for more yogurt?

18
00:02:10,080 --> 00:02:11,400
-Come again. Bye.
-How many cups would you like?

19
00:02:11,480 --> 00:02:13,240
-Fifty cups.
-What?

20
00:02:14,200 --> 00:02:16,920
I gave some to my friends,
and they loved it.

21
00:02:17,000 --> 00:02:20,000
So I'd like to sell your yogurt
at my coffee shop.

22
00:02:20,080 --> 00:02:21,160
Sure. We'll get your order ready.

23
00:02:21,240 --> 00:02:22,200
-Thank you.
-Thank you.

24
00:02:22,280 --> 00:02:23,640
You're welcome.

25
00:02:23,720 --> 00:02:26,680
-Hurry up, sweetie.
-And deliver it to me every day.

26
00:02:26,760 --> 00:02:30,240
We can discuss your wholesale price later.

27
00:02:30,320 --> 00:02:31,960
-Wow!
-Of course. Thank you.

28
00:02:32,040 --> 00:02:33,080
-Sure.
-Every day!

29
00:02:35,920 --> 00:02:36,880
Too far for a high-five.

30
00:02:40,920 --> 00:02:42,320
BUYING BUFFALO MILK - 60 BAHT PER KG
DAN DAO FARM BUFFALO MILK

31
00:02:42,400 --> 00:02:44,920
Thanks for coming today, everyone.

32
00:02:45,000 --> 00:02:48,040
I wanted to let you know
that Dan Dao Buffalo Farm

33
00:02:48,120 --> 00:02:52,320
is buying buffalo milk.
If you have any to sell, contact Auem,

34
00:02:52,400 --> 00:02:55,040
and please spread the word.

35
00:03:02,360 --> 00:03:06,400
Uncle, we're buying raw buffalo milk
for 60 baht a kilo.

36
00:03:06,480 --> 00:03:09,240
If you're interested,
message Dan Dao Farm on Line.

37
00:03:15,920 --> 00:03:20,160
If you're in the Ayutthaya area
and have buffalo milk to sell,

38
00:03:20,240 --> 00:03:23,040
contact Dan Dao Buffalo Farm.

39
00:03:23,120 --> 00:03:26,160
We'll leave our address
and phone number below.

40
00:03:26,240 --> 00:03:30,320
If you'd like some buffalo milk yogurt,
you can order that too.

41
00:03:31,120 --> 00:03:34,600
-Order ten cups and get free delivery!
-Yeah.

42
00:03:34,680 --> 00:03:36,800
BOONYOD FARM

43
00:03:49,520 --> 00:03:50,560
Here it is.

44
00:03:53,200 --> 00:03:55,200
Here. Fifty thousand baht

45
00:03:55,280 --> 00:03:57,440
for the calf, as agreed.

46
00:03:57,520 --> 00:03:59,400
Thank you so much, Boss.

47
00:04:04,120 --> 00:04:05,280
By the way,

48
00:04:05,360 --> 00:04:08,480
what's wrong with its mother?
Why are they in separate pens?

49
00:04:08,560 --> 00:04:11,600
She's got mastitis. Her milk's gone bad,

50
00:04:11,680 --> 00:04:13,880
so her calf can't drink it.

51
00:04:13,960 --> 00:04:15,680
It might catch the infection.

52
00:04:15,760 --> 00:04:19,279
I've tried cold compresses and medication,

53
00:04:19,360 --> 00:04:20,800
but she's not getting better.

54
00:04:20,880 --> 00:04:22,360
And I'm running out of money.

55
00:04:22,880 --> 00:04:25,640
That's why I had to sell you her calf.

56
00:04:30,040 --> 00:04:31,680
What if

57
00:04:32,320 --> 00:04:35,440
I wanted to buy the mother too?
Would you sell her?

58
00:04:36,080 --> 00:04:38,120
But she's still sick.

59
00:04:38,200 --> 00:04:42,080
You can't afford to treat her here.
She'll be better off with me.

60
00:04:43,240 --> 00:04:44,240
I'll give you 100,000 baht.

61
00:05:02,600 --> 00:05:04,760
-I've brought some milk to sell.
-Oh, sure.

62
00:05:04,840 --> 00:05:08,360
Please write down
your name and phone number.

63
00:05:25,200 --> 00:05:27,440
-Four kilos.
-Okay.

64
00:05:38,560 --> 00:05:39,760
Here you go.

65
00:05:40,560 --> 00:05:43,720
Four kilos comes to 240 baht.

66
00:05:44,840 --> 00:05:47,480
Bring me more whenever you have some.
I'm always buying.

67
00:05:47,560 --> 00:05:48,400
Sure.

68
00:06:01,800 --> 00:06:02,760
Hello.

69
00:06:03,680 --> 00:06:05,680
I've sold them the milk, Boss.

70
00:06:08,240 --> 00:06:09,200
Good.

71
00:06:12,440 --> 00:06:14,280
There's no way

72
00:06:14,960 --> 00:06:18,200
you bastards can raise enough money
to get Hom Thong back in three months.

73
00:06:25,640 --> 00:06:27,440
Don't you have any yogurt today?

74
00:06:27,520 --> 00:06:30,480
Auem's bringing some over.
Why don't you look around while you wait?

75
00:06:30,560 --> 00:06:31,560
Okay, sure.

76
00:06:34,520 --> 00:06:39,080
TEN BAHT EACH

77
00:06:39,160 --> 00:06:40,400
Hello.

78
00:06:41,560 --> 00:06:42,400
Yes, speaking.

79
00:06:43,520 --> 00:06:45,600
You'd like us to review a product?

80
00:06:45,680 --> 00:06:47,760
What kind of product?

81
00:06:50,280 --> 00:06:53,640
Buffalo shampoo? What?

82
00:06:56,920 --> 00:06:58,680
Okay, please add me on Line

83
00:06:58,760 --> 00:07:01,320
with this number, and we'll talk there.

84
00:07:01,400 --> 00:07:02,880
Okay, thank you.

85
00:07:03,440 --> 00:07:04,280
What is it, sweetie?

86
00:07:04,360 --> 00:07:07,520
Mom, someone wants to pay
Por Chang and Phet Kla 50,000 each

87
00:07:07,600 --> 00:07:09,280
to promote buffalo shampoo!

88
00:07:09,360 --> 00:07:10,200
What?

89
00:07:10,720 --> 00:07:11,880
Fifty thousand?

90
00:07:11,960 --> 00:07:14,200
That's 100,000 for the two of them?

91
00:07:14,280 --> 00:07:15,440
Yes!

92
00:07:16,680 --> 00:07:18,840
Wow, we're getting 100,000 baht?

93
00:07:18,920 --> 00:07:21,680
-Have they sent the details yet?
-Not yet.

94
00:07:21,760 --> 00:07:22,840
-Auem!
-Yes?

95
00:07:23,560 --> 00:07:24,880
We're getting 100,000 baht!

96
00:07:25,480 --> 00:07:27,040
Someone just called Orn and said

97
00:07:27,120 --> 00:07:30,200
they want to hire Phet Kla and Por Chang
to review a shampoo.

98
00:07:30,280 --> 00:07:31,480
Then…

99
00:07:31,560 --> 00:07:34,720
Orn, tell them we need
a 20,000-baht deposit upfront.

100
00:07:34,800 --> 00:07:36,520
We'll figure out what to film tonight.

101
00:07:36,600 --> 00:07:37,880
-Wow, smart thinking!
-Tell them.

102
00:07:37,960 --> 00:07:38,960
-Tell them now.
-Wow!

103
00:07:39,040 --> 00:07:42,160
The meatballs are selling well,
and so is the yogurt.

104
00:07:42,240 --> 00:07:43,760
And you're even getting paid
to review products.

105
00:07:43,840 --> 00:07:46,880
At this rate, you'll definitely get
Hom Thong back within three months.

106
00:07:49,960 --> 00:07:53,000
-A hundred thousand! I'm so happy!
-I'll put the yogurt over there.

107
00:07:53,600 --> 00:07:55,040
-Over there is fine, Din.
-Okay.

108
00:07:56,200 --> 00:07:57,920
-They've transferred the money.
-Really?

109
00:07:58,000 --> 00:07:59,120
Did you already tell them…

110
00:08:00,040 --> 00:08:01,520
Hello, Khwanchai.

111
00:08:01,600 --> 00:08:04,480
I've already tricked them
with the fake shampoo deal.

112
00:08:05,520 --> 00:08:08,760
Next, I'll order their meatballs
and have them deliver them.

113
00:08:10,120 --> 00:08:10,960
Yes, sir.

114
00:08:15,560 --> 00:08:20,080
Is this Beauty Queen's Meatballs?

115
00:08:21,680 --> 00:08:27,440
I'd like to order 30 kilos of meatballs.

116
00:08:28,480 --> 00:08:29,760
Send!

117
00:08:34,320 --> 00:08:36,080
Orn, do you smell that?

118
00:08:37,200 --> 00:08:41,039
Ugh, it stinks, Ob! What's that smell?

119
00:08:41,120 --> 00:08:44,120
"It's me."

120
00:08:44,640 --> 00:08:46,200
Whoa, Phet Kla!

121
00:08:46,280 --> 00:08:48,200
What have you been up to? You stink!

122
00:08:48,280 --> 00:08:50,040
"I have no idea.

123
00:08:50,120 --> 00:08:53,960
Is there anything that'll make me
smell nice again?"

124
00:08:54,680 --> 00:08:56,240
Of course. Look!

125
00:08:56,320 --> 00:08:59,520
Buffalo Care Shampoo,
made with soapnut extract.

126
00:08:59,600 --> 00:09:02,640
It eliminates bad odors, relieves itching,

127
00:09:02,720 --> 00:09:04,520
and leaves their skin shiny too.

128
00:09:04,600 --> 00:09:06,200
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">Want to order some?</font></font></i>

129
00:09:06,280 --> 00:09:08,040
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">Just add it to your cart!</font></font></i>

130
00:09:08,120 --> 00:09:09,920
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">We'll pin it right here.</font></font></i>

131
00:09:10,000 --> 00:09:11,560
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">Go on, tap it!</font></font></i>

132
00:09:12,080 --> 00:09:13,680
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">Order now!</font></font></i>

133
00:09:16,360 --> 00:09:18,600
-Should I post it, Ob?
-This one's good.

134
00:09:18,680 --> 00:09:20,680
-Go for it!
-Let's do it.

135
00:09:20,760 --> 00:09:21,960
This one.

136
00:09:24,680 --> 00:09:26,360
So cool!

137
00:09:26,880 --> 00:09:29,320
That's awesome! Whoa, it's so green!

138
00:09:29,400 --> 00:09:32,640
BUFFALO CARE SHAMPOO

139
00:09:32,720 --> 00:09:34,360
BUFFALO MILK YOGURT

140
00:09:36,920 --> 00:09:38,360
Here they are.

141
00:09:43,120 --> 00:09:44,360
Auem.

142
00:09:44,440 --> 00:09:46,000
I'm sorry.

143
00:09:46,080 --> 00:09:47,640
It's okay, Rung.

144
00:09:47,720 --> 00:09:48,880
Get a cloth and wipe it up.

145
00:09:48,960 --> 00:09:50,120
I'm so clumsy.

146
00:09:51,440 --> 00:09:52,480
Oh, no!

147
00:09:52,560 --> 00:09:54,240
It's all over the place.

148
00:09:57,840 --> 00:09:59,440
Doesn't the yogurt smell a bit strange?

149
00:10:07,120 --> 00:10:07,960
You're right.

150
00:10:08,640 --> 00:10:10,760
It's not like the yogurt you usually make.

151
00:10:10,840 --> 00:10:15,080
The texture isn't smooth,
and it hasn't set properly either.

152
00:10:25,760 --> 00:10:27,360
-Check another one.
-Rung, open another one.

153
00:10:39,280 --> 00:10:40,240
Oh.

154
00:10:40,760 --> 00:10:42,440
Okay, thanks, Tom.

155
00:10:42,520 --> 00:10:46,240
BUFFALO MILK YOGURT

156
00:10:46,320 --> 00:10:48,320
I sent Tom the photos.

157
00:10:48,400 --> 00:10:50,520
He says the milk we used
to make the yogurt

158
00:10:50,600 --> 00:10:51,960
was probably contaminated with bacteria.

159
00:10:52,880 --> 00:10:54,000
Bacteria?

160
00:10:54,080 --> 00:10:56,160
Yes. He thinks

161
00:10:56,240 --> 00:10:59,600
it came from a sick buffalo,
possibly one with mastitis.

162
00:11:00,880 --> 00:11:02,320
If the buffalo had mastitis,

163
00:11:02,400 --> 00:11:04,360
we can't sell this whole batch.

164
00:11:04,880 --> 00:11:07,160
Anyone who eats it
could end up with diarrhea.

165
00:11:07,240 --> 00:11:10,120
So we have nothing
to deliver to our customers today?

166
00:11:14,760 --> 00:11:15,960
Auem!

167
00:11:17,800 --> 00:11:18,880
We've got a problem, Auem.

168
00:11:20,600 --> 00:11:22,200
Orn and I were bathing

169
00:11:22,280 --> 00:11:24,320
Por Chang and Phet Kla earlier

170
00:11:24,400 --> 00:11:26,480
for another shampoo review.

171
00:11:26,560 --> 00:11:29,160
That's when we noticed
rashes all over them.

172
00:11:40,680 --> 00:11:41,520
Din.

173
00:11:42,800 --> 00:11:44,880
Did you feed the buffaloes
anything unusual yesterday?

174
00:11:44,960 --> 00:11:47,360
After filming the review,
I took them back to their pens

175
00:11:47,440 --> 00:11:49,440
and fed them their usual food.

176
00:11:52,080 --> 00:11:52,920
Ob.

177
00:11:53,840 --> 00:11:56,000
Bring me the shampoo
you used on the buffaloes.

178
00:11:59,920 --> 00:12:00,760
BUFFALO CARE SHAMPOO

179
00:12:11,240 --> 00:12:12,520
This shampoo feels weirdly sticky.

180
00:12:14,560 --> 00:12:17,880
I think this shampoo
might be contaminated with chemicals.

181
00:12:18,400 --> 00:12:20,240
That's probably what's causing the rashes.

182
00:12:21,000 --> 00:12:24,480
Orn, give me the number of the client
who hired us.

183
00:12:28,720 --> 00:12:32,120
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">You've reached our voicemail service.</font></font></i>

184
00:12:32,200 --> 00:12:34,040
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">Please leave your message.</font></font></i>

185
00:12:35,920 --> 00:12:36,800
They're not answering.

186
00:12:38,480 --> 00:12:40,560
What about the remaining 80,000 baht
they promised?

187
00:12:40,640 --> 00:12:41,680
Have they transferred it?

188
00:12:41,760 --> 00:12:44,600
Not yet, Auem. They said

189
00:12:44,680 --> 00:12:47,560
they'd only pay us
after we sent them the second video.

190
00:12:51,320 --> 00:12:52,440
Hello, Mom?

191
00:12:55,760 --> 00:12:56,880
Look,

192
00:12:56,960 --> 00:12:59,720
I went to the address
the customer gave me,

193
00:12:59,800 --> 00:13:02,600
but it turned out to be
an abandoned house.

194
00:13:02,680 --> 00:13:03,520
Look at this.

195
00:13:03,600 --> 00:13:04,560
-Sa-Ing.
-Huh?

196
00:13:04,640 --> 00:13:06,000
It's the exact same house!

197
00:13:06,080 --> 00:13:07,280
-Let me see.
-Here.

198
00:13:07,360 --> 00:13:08,560
Oh!

199
00:13:09,280 --> 00:13:11,560
It really is the same house!

200
00:13:13,720 --> 00:13:16,880
I tried calling,
but the phone's switched off.

201
00:13:16,960 --> 00:13:18,400
Something's not right.

202
00:13:18,920 --> 00:13:21,200
First the yogurt, then the shampoo,

203
00:13:21,280 --> 00:13:23,200
and now Aunt Sa-Ing's meatballs.

204
00:13:23,280 --> 00:13:25,240
Someone must be trying to sabotage us.

205
00:13:25,320 --> 00:13:26,960
Sia Aun?

206
00:13:30,640 --> 00:13:32,160
It doesn't matter who's behind this.

207
00:13:32,240 --> 00:13:34,560
Let's focus on fixing
these problems first.

208
00:13:43,920 --> 00:13:46,720
Aloe vera has a cooling effect

209
00:13:46,800 --> 00:13:48,120
that helps reduce inflammation.

210
00:13:49,560 --> 00:13:51,240
We can apply it to the rashes

211
00:13:52,000 --> 00:13:53,200
to soothe the irritation.

212
00:13:54,560 --> 00:13:55,440
Give me a hand.

213
00:14:04,800 --> 00:14:06,440
On my next livestream,

214
00:14:06,520 --> 00:14:08,360
I'll show everyone how to do this

215
00:14:08,440 --> 00:14:10,840
and share some traditional remedies.

216
00:14:10,920 --> 00:14:13,560
Even though we've applied aloe vera,

217
00:14:14,080 --> 00:14:16,920
you should still get the vet
to give them a shot, just in case.

218
00:14:17,440 --> 00:14:20,640
I've already called Dr. Sun.
He'll be here soon.

219
00:14:22,360 --> 00:14:23,440
Hey, Auem.

220
00:14:23,520 --> 00:14:25,640
-Yeah?
-About our product review video,

221
00:14:25,720 --> 00:14:28,120
Orn and I have posted a warning

222
00:14:28,200 --> 00:14:30,680
that the shampoo isn't safe.

223
00:14:31,560 --> 00:14:35,000
And we've taken down
our original review too.

224
00:14:36,800 --> 00:14:39,840
Auem, Din, Uncle Tik.

225
00:14:40,360 --> 00:14:43,600
I'm sorry I took the job
without checking everything first.

226
00:14:44,160 --> 00:14:45,560
I'll be more careful from now on.

227
00:14:46,600 --> 00:14:47,840
It's not your fault, Orn.

228
00:14:47,920 --> 00:14:50,720
It's my fault too.
I should've checked more carefully.

229
00:14:51,600 --> 00:14:53,560
What about Aunt Sa-Ing's meatballs?

230
00:14:53,640 --> 00:14:55,840
What are you going to do
with all 30 kilos?

231
00:15:00,160 --> 00:15:04,440
Everyone, Sa-Ing's freshly made
pork meatballs are here!

232
00:15:04,520 --> 00:15:07,520
Today, Sa-Ing's freshly made
pork meatballs

233
00:15:07,600 --> 00:15:10,360
are coming straight to you!

234
00:15:10,440 --> 00:15:13,080
Freshly made, springy,
chewy pork meatballs!

235
00:15:13,160 --> 00:15:15,480
Just 35 baht for seven!

236
00:15:15,560 --> 00:15:18,040
-Would you like some meatballs?
-Alright!

237
00:15:18,120 --> 00:15:20,960
-Sa-Ing's freshly made pork meatballs!
-Pull over!

238
00:15:21,040 --> 00:15:22,000
How many sets would you like?

239
00:15:22,080 --> 00:15:23,480
-Two sets, please.
-Two sets.

240
00:15:23,560 --> 00:15:24,720
How many sets?

241
00:15:24,800 --> 00:15:25,640
Here you go.

242
00:15:25,720 --> 00:15:27,000
Three sets for 100 baht.

243
00:15:31,200 --> 00:15:33,480
500 G 100 BAHT, 1 KG 200 BAHT

244
00:15:34,520 --> 00:15:35,600
NEW POST, POSTING

245
00:15:37,680 --> 00:15:39,680
BEAUTY QUEEN SA-ING'S MEATBALLS

246
00:15:46,200 --> 00:15:48,200
BEAUTY QUEEN SA-ING'S MEATBALLS

247
00:16:09,720 --> 00:16:11,160
Come on, everyone!

248
00:16:12,360 --> 00:16:14,560
Mom, what are we having today?

249
00:16:17,840 --> 00:16:19,480
Spicy meatball salad.

250
00:16:19,560 --> 00:16:22,040
Huh? We still haven't finished them?

251
00:16:22,120 --> 00:16:24,680
What? We've still got a kilo left.

252
00:16:24,760 --> 00:16:26,000
Help me finish them off!

253
00:16:31,600 --> 00:16:33,400
Auem, how's it looking?

254
00:16:34,160 --> 00:16:36,000
We're still losing money, Mom.

255
00:16:36,520 --> 00:16:37,360
Oh, no.

256
00:16:37,880 --> 00:16:40,120
We didn't get the 80,000 baht
we were counting on.

257
00:16:40,200 --> 00:16:43,520
We couldn't deliver the yogurt
and had to throw out all our stored milk.

258
00:16:43,600 --> 00:16:46,280
We don't know what else
it might be contaminated with.

259
00:16:46,360 --> 00:16:47,800
Oh, no.

260
00:16:48,920 --> 00:16:50,760
Should we go confront Sia Aun, Auem?

261
00:16:50,840 --> 00:16:52,480
-Exactly.
-How can we go after him?

262
00:16:52,560 --> 00:16:54,480
-Right.
-We don't have any proof, Ob.

263
00:16:54,560 --> 00:16:57,040
But if they keep sabotaging us,

264
00:16:57,120 --> 00:16:59,400
we won't have enough to buy
Hom Thong back in three months.

265
00:16:59,480 --> 00:17:00,520
Oh, no.

266
00:17:01,440 --> 00:17:03,480
-Ugh!
-Auem.

267
00:17:04,839 --> 00:17:07,280
I've got another idea to help raise money.

268
00:17:12,280 --> 00:17:13,400
Hi, everyone.

269
00:17:13,480 --> 00:17:16,400
We've got some good news for everyone here

270
00:17:16,480 --> 00:17:18,560
on Auemdao and the Buffaloes.

271
00:17:18,640 --> 00:17:19,560
And that is…

272
00:17:20,839 --> 00:17:23,040
We're putting
Por Chang's semen up for sale!

273
00:17:28,440 --> 00:17:29,920
"Can't wait."

274
00:17:30,960 --> 00:17:34,200
But we're only selling five doses

275
00:17:34,280 --> 00:17:36,240
at 5,000 baht each.

276
00:17:38,720 --> 00:17:40,720
"What time do sales start?"

277
00:17:40,800 --> 00:17:43,280
It's 3:50 p.m. right now.

278
00:17:43,360 --> 00:17:46,160
I'll put them up for sale
in my shop at 4 p.m.

279
00:17:46,240 --> 00:17:48,640
The first five people
to place their orders

280
00:17:48,720 --> 00:17:51,520
will get a dose of Por Chang's semen!

281
00:17:54,400 --> 00:17:55,400
Uncle Tik.

282
00:17:56,240 --> 00:17:59,360
Are you sure you really want
to sell Por Chang's semen?

283
00:18:00,720 --> 00:18:01,680
Yeah.

284
00:18:01,760 --> 00:18:03,200
I've thought it through.

285
00:18:04,160 --> 00:18:06,720
This way, Auem will have enough money
to get Hom Thong back.

286
00:18:07,240 --> 00:18:10,680
And Sia Aun will finally leave her alone.

287
00:18:12,800 --> 00:18:14,800
Alright. Thanks, man.

288
00:18:15,920 --> 00:18:16,880
-Boss.
-Yeah?

289
00:18:16,960 --> 00:18:19,400
My friend just called to tell me

290
00:18:19,480 --> 00:18:21,960
Auem's selling Por Chang's semen
at four today.

291
00:18:25,200 --> 00:18:27,080
Why the hell didn't you tell me sooner?

292
00:18:27,160 --> 00:18:29,520
-Hurry up and get some!
-Yes, Boss.

293
00:18:34,000 --> 00:18:36,600
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">It's almost time, everyone. Are you ready?</font></font></i>

294
00:18:36,680 --> 00:18:37,880
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">I'm about to put them up for sale.</font></font></i>

295
00:18:38,960 --> 00:18:40,360
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">Five,</font></font></i>

296
00:18:40,440 --> 00:18:43,640
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">four, three, two, one.</font></font></i>

297
00:18:43,720 --> 00:18:45,040
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">Add it to your cart now!</font></font></i>

298
00:18:45,120 --> 00:18:46,840
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">Hurry! Add it now!</font></font></i>

299
00:18:46,920 --> 00:18:48,160
-Did you get one?
-<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">Who got one?</font></font></i>

300
00:18:48,800 --> 00:18:51,160
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">Oh! We're sold out, everyone.</font></font></i>

301
00:18:53,320 --> 00:18:55,920
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">Thank you so much.</font></font></i>
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">If you're one of the first five buyers,</font></font></i>

302
00:18:56,000 --> 00:18:59,520
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">please message me to confirm.</font></font></i>

303
00:18:59,600 --> 00:19:02,200
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">Who managed to get one?</font></font></i>

304
00:19:03,120 --> 00:19:05,600
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">Whoa! So many people missed out.</font></font></i>

305
00:19:05,680 --> 00:19:08,480
Find those five buyers
and get them to sell to us.

306
00:19:09,000 --> 00:19:11,640
Tell them I'll pay 50,000 baht per dose.

307
00:19:12,280 --> 00:19:13,440
Yes, Boss.

308
00:19:19,640 --> 00:19:21,240
Here, 50,000 baht.

309
00:19:21,320 --> 00:19:22,320
Thank you, Boss.

310
00:19:22,400 --> 00:19:25,160
I didn't know you wanted
Por Chang's semen so badly.

311
00:19:25,240 --> 00:19:28,240
I'm just trying to improve
the giant buffalo breed.

312
00:19:28,760 --> 00:19:31,960
If you get a calf,
feel free to contact me.

313
00:19:32,880 --> 00:19:34,480
-Thanks.
-You're welcome.

314
00:19:35,080 --> 00:19:36,160
I'll get going, then.

315
00:19:40,320 --> 00:19:42,240
-We got all four doses?
-Yes, Boss.

316
00:19:42,320 --> 00:19:44,680
-What about the fifth buyer?
-He's on his way.

317
00:19:44,760 --> 00:19:46,080
I arranged to meet him at noon.

318
00:19:48,600 --> 00:19:50,240
Waiting for me, huh?

319
00:19:57,960 --> 00:19:59,200
Why would I wait for you?

320
00:20:00,160 --> 00:20:02,960
You're waiting to buy
Por Chang's semen from the fifth buyer.

321
00:20:04,840 --> 00:20:06,120
Here you go.

322
00:20:06,200 --> 00:20:08,400
This semen is from Por Chang…

323
00:20:08,480 --> 00:20:09,680
Turbo.

324
00:20:10,600 --> 00:20:13,640
Por Chang Turbo? What the hell?

325
00:20:13,720 --> 00:20:17,760
It belongs to a good friend of mine.
His name's Por Chang Turbo.

326
00:20:17,840 --> 00:20:21,760
I even drove all the way to Kalasin
to collect his semen for you.

327
00:20:21,840 --> 00:20:23,040
Hey, hold on.

328
00:20:23,560 --> 00:20:27,160
Are you saying those five doses you sold

329
00:20:27,240 --> 00:20:29,000
weren't from your Por Chang?

330
00:20:29,720 --> 00:20:30,560
Exactly.

331
00:20:31,920 --> 00:20:33,160
I knew all along

332
00:20:33,680 --> 00:20:36,440
you'd try to buy up all the semen
from the five buyers.

333
00:20:38,040 --> 00:20:40,040
But thanks for the 200,000 baht

334
00:20:40,120 --> 00:20:42,800
you paid for those four doses.

335
00:20:42,880 --> 00:20:46,320
Now Auem will have the money
to buy Hom Thong back from you.

336
00:20:46,400 --> 00:20:49,960
So the people who sold me the semen
were working for you?

337
00:20:50,040 --> 00:20:51,000
That's right.

338
00:20:51,080 --> 00:20:52,720
So you're playing dirty?

339
00:20:52,800 --> 00:20:56,760
Fine. I'm reporting you
to the police for fraud!

340
00:20:56,840 --> 00:20:57,680
What fraud?

341
00:20:58,200 --> 00:21:00,320
I've got proof
that I really collected the semen.

342
00:21:00,400 --> 00:21:02,880
And Auem never said during the livestream

343
00:21:02,960 --> 00:21:04,760
that it came from my Por Chang.

344
00:21:05,680 --> 00:21:08,480
-You bastard, Tik!
-Hey, don't get angry just yet.

345
00:21:09,000 --> 00:21:10,880
You still have something to make up for.

346
00:21:10,960 --> 00:21:12,360
Make up for what?

347
00:21:16,200 --> 00:21:17,120
Hello, Din.

348
00:21:18,000 --> 00:21:19,080
At the police station yet?

349
00:21:19,760 --> 00:21:21,160
Yes, Uncle. I'm here.

350
00:21:22,080 --> 00:21:23,840
Okay, I'll turn on the camera.

351
00:21:29,240 --> 00:21:31,560
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">Boss! Please help me, Boss!</font></font></i>

352
00:21:31,640 --> 00:21:33,880
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">-Boss!</font></font></i>
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">-Don't bother begging.</font></font></i>

353
00:21:34,440 --> 00:21:36,000
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">He's confessed everything.</font></font></i>

354
00:21:36,080 --> 00:21:39,680
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">You hired him to sell milk</font></font></i>
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">from a buffalo with mastitis</font></font></i>

355
00:21:39,760 --> 00:21:40,960
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">to Auem.</font></font></i>

356
00:21:44,160 --> 00:21:47,440
You owe me 50,000 baht in compensation.

357
00:21:49,120 --> 00:21:50,480
Fifty thousand?

358
00:21:50,560 --> 00:21:52,680
Pay up, or Auem will press charges.

359
00:21:52,760 --> 00:21:54,640
This time, you'll be all over the news.

360
00:21:54,720 --> 00:21:59,240
You rigged the buffalo contest,
and now you're bullying the defenseless.

361
00:22:13,440 --> 00:22:16,360
This one's probably ready, sweetie.
Here, take this one.

362
00:22:17,240 --> 00:22:18,080
Auem.

363
00:22:18,600 --> 00:22:19,440
Thanks, Mom.

364
00:22:19,520 --> 00:22:22,600
Eat up. You've had a rough few days.

365
00:22:23,640 --> 00:22:25,960
-Thanks, Mom. Here, eat this.
-Here, Orn.

366
00:22:26,040 --> 00:22:27,000
-Yeah, I'll take that one.
-Let's eat.

367
00:22:27,080 --> 00:22:30,360
You eat up too, Mom.
You'll need energy to make more meatballs.

368
00:22:30,440 --> 00:22:32,360
-Okay.
-Thank you.

369
00:22:32,960 --> 00:22:35,680
What about me?
Nobody's getting me anything.

370
00:22:35,760 --> 00:22:38,000
-Hold on.
-Says who? I'm getting you squid.

371
00:22:38,080 --> 00:22:39,800
-I know you love it.
-I even blew on it for you.

372
00:22:39,880 --> 00:22:40,880
How's that?

373
00:22:41,680 --> 00:22:43,200
Much better. Thank you.

374
00:22:44,240 --> 00:22:45,320
Auem.

375
00:22:45,400 --> 00:22:47,800
-Yeah?
-Can I see our bank balance?

376
00:22:47,880 --> 00:22:49,240
Hang on.

377
00:22:50,920 --> 00:22:51,760
Here.

378
00:22:52,360 --> 00:22:53,520
Why do you want to see it?

379
00:22:55,080 --> 00:22:56,640
This feels so satisfying!

380
00:22:57,160 --> 00:22:59,320
Sia Aun's stupidity cost him 250,000 baht!

381
00:22:59,920 --> 00:23:02,160
We really have Uncle Tik
to thank for that plan.

382
00:23:02,240 --> 00:23:04,840
We'd be in serious trouble without him.

383
00:23:04,920 --> 00:23:06,560
-So…
-This feels so good!

384
00:23:06,640 --> 00:23:08,360
We're close to getting
Hom Thong back, right?

385
00:23:08,440 --> 00:23:09,320
Yeah.

386
00:23:10,800 --> 00:23:13,920
Thank you so much for all your help,
Mom, Orn, and Ob.

387
00:23:14,000 --> 00:23:18,240
I promise we won't have
to work this hard much longer.

388
00:23:21,680 --> 00:23:23,800
-Sure.
-In that case,

389
00:23:24,320 --> 00:23:25,600
grab a piece of pork.

390
00:23:26,480 --> 00:23:27,800
-Okay.
-Come on.

391
00:23:29,200 --> 00:23:30,760
And say it together.

392
00:23:30,840 --> 00:23:33,600
We can do it!

393
00:24:06,120 --> 00:24:08,320
Your owner's really screwed me over.

394
00:24:12,600 --> 00:24:14,160
What should I do with you?

395
00:24:22,360 --> 00:24:23,200
Boss.

396
00:24:24,400 --> 00:24:26,960
A foreign buyer contacted us
about buying Hom Thong.

397
00:24:27,040 --> 00:24:28,720
But I turned him down.

398
00:24:30,160 --> 00:24:32,400
-How much did he offer?
-Five million baht.

399
00:24:37,840 --> 00:24:40,640
Since your owner cost me money,

400
00:24:40,720 --> 00:24:43,920
you'll have to pay me back with interest.

401
00:24:45,160 --> 00:24:47,800
Tell him I'll sell.

402
00:24:47,880 --> 00:24:48,720
Yes, Boss.

403
00:24:55,240 --> 00:24:57,480
You're going overseas.

404
00:24:58,240 --> 00:25:01,760
I wonder how your owner will feel.

405
00:25:11,160 --> 00:25:13,040
MAE RIEN PICKLED GARLIC JUICE

406
00:25:13,120 --> 00:25:16,000
MAE RIEN PICKLED GARLIC JUICE

407
00:25:16,080 --> 00:25:18,000
MAE RIEN FERMENTED FISH SAUCE

408
00:25:20,800 --> 00:25:22,120
-Auem!
-Yeah?

409
00:25:22,200 --> 00:25:25,120
-Are you done? The monks are almost here.
-Almost. Just a minute.

410
00:25:30,600 --> 00:25:31,600
Yod!

411
00:25:32,160 --> 00:25:35,000
I brought you some yogurt
and meatballs today.

412
00:25:35,080 --> 00:25:38,200
You know, our shop's been open
for a whole month now,

413
00:25:38,800 --> 00:25:42,120
and the yogurt and meatballs
are selling like crazy!

414
00:25:42,200 --> 00:25:44,640
People line up for them every day.

415
00:25:44,720 --> 00:25:46,560
Lucky you, though.

416
00:25:46,640 --> 00:25:49,360
You don't have to wait in line. How nice!

417
00:25:51,320 --> 00:25:52,360
Mom, the monks are here.

418
00:25:59,800 --> 00:26:00,880
Go ahead.

419
00:26:21,720 --> 00:26:22,800
Yod!

420
00:26:22,880 --> 00:26:27,440
Hey, keep watching over the kids,
will you?

421
00:26:27,520 --> 00:26:30,080
And if it's not too much trouble,

422
00:26:30,600 --> 00:26:32,880
visit me in my dreams
and give me some lucky numbers.

423
00:26:33,400 --> 00:26:35,880
Maybe that'll help us
raise some more money.

424
00:26:37,520 --> 00:26:38,800
Right, Hom Ngern?

425
00:26:41,200 --> 00:26:42,960
Oh! She answered. What did she say?

426
00:26:43,040 --> 00:26:44,560
-Yes!
-She said yes, Mom.

427
00:26:51,040 --> 00:26:52,080
Alright, everyone.

428
00:26:52,160 --> 00:26:55,120
Let's see this month's profits
after expenses.

429
00:26:56,440 --> 00:26:59,640
Let's start with
Beauty Queen Sa-Ing's Meatballs.

430
00:26:59,720 --> 00:27:01,640
How much profit did we make?

431
00:27:01,720 --> 00:27:03,680
-Any guesses?
-Twenty thousand baht!

432
00:27:03,760 --> 00:27:05,720
-Twenty thousand baht?
-Let's go with 20,000!

433
00:27:05,800 --> 00:27:06,960
-That much?
-Huh?

434
00:27:07,680 --> 00:27:09,240
-Why?
-Wait.

435
00:27:09,320 --> 00:27:11,280
I'm guessing 25,000.

436
00:27:11,360 --> 00:27:13,240
Twenty-five thousand baht?

437
00:27:13,320 --> 00:27:14,200
That's right!

438
00:27:14,280 --> 00:27:16,160
How about we reveal it now?

439
00:27:16,240 --> 00:27:17,520
-Sure.
-Alright.

440
00:27:18,040 --> 00:27:19,680
How much?

441
00:27:20,200 --> 00:27:21,760
Thirty thousand baht!

442
00:27:22,720 --> 00:27:23,840
Thirty thousand baht!

443
00:27:26,360 --> 00:27:29,360
Wow! Mom and Auntie made 30,000 baht?

444
00:27:29,440 --> 00:27:31,640
-I'm so happy.
-Alright.

445
00:27:31,720 --> 00:27:34,840
Next up,
Dan Dao Farm's buffalo milk yogurt.

446
00:27:34,920 --> 00:27:38,600
-Any guesses?
-We made 30,000 last month, right?

447
00:27:38,680 --> 00:27:40,920
I'm going with 40,000 this month!

448
00:27:43,120 --> 00:27:44,760
-What do you think?
-That's the spirit!

449
00:27:44,840 --> 00:27:46,200
How much do you think?

450
00:27:46,280 --> 00:27:47,920
How much?

451
00:27:48,000 --> 00:27:49,000
How much?

452
00:27:49,080 --> 00:27:51,000
Whoa!

453
00:27:51,080 --> 00:27:53,560
Seventy-two thousand baht!

454
00:27:55,680 --> 00:27:59,040
Next, Phet Kla's semen sales.

455
00:27:59,120 --> 00:28:00,120
Seventy thousand baht.

456
00:28:01,520 --> 00:28:05,360
We made 210,000 baht.
Divided by three, that's 70,000 baht.

457
00:28:08,040 --> 00:28:09,400
Reveal it. It's 70,000 baht.

458
00:28:09,480 --> 00:28:11,880
-Let's reveal the answer.
-Go on! Show us.

459
00:28:12,520 --> 00:28:15,120
-There! Seventy thousand baht!
-Come on!

460
00:28:15,200 --> 00:28:17,080
Why'd you spoil it?
We were having fun guessing.

461
00:28:17,160 --> 00:28:19,480
-You've ruined the fun!
-Come on, Mom!

462
00:28:19,560 --> 00:28:22,280
Just pretend you didn't hear me,
Beauty Queen Meatball Lady.

463
00:28:22,360 --> 00:28:24,360
-How can I? My ears work just fine.
-That's enough!

464
00:28:24,440 --> 00:28:27,280
-Mom!
-Was I right? Exactly 70,000.

465
00:28:27,360 --> 00:28:28,680
-Keep going, Auem.
-That's no fun.

466
00:28:28,760 --> 00:28:30,680
How much from product reviews
and grass sales?

467
00:28:30,760 --> 00:28:32,840
-Continue.
-Any guesses, everyone?

468
00:28:35,640 --> 00:28:36,920
-Ready for the answer?
-Tell us!

469
00:28:37,000 --> 00:28:38,400
-Reveal it! I can't guess.
-One.

470
00:28:39,440 --> 00:28:40,600
Two.

471
00:28:40,680 --> 00:28:42,160
Hope we made a lot.

472
00:28:42,240 --> 00:28:44,240
Thirty-two thousand baht!

473
00:28:47,280 --> 00:28:48,320
Give yourselves a hand.

474
00:28:49,160 --> 00:28:52,640
Thirty-two thousand baht.
Let's move on to our last business.

475
00:28:52,720 --> 00:28:56,240
Pangola grass, hydroponic vegetables,
and mushrooms.

476
00:28:56,800 --> 00:28:58,480
The profit is…

477
00:28:58,560 --> 00:28:59,880
How much is it?

478
00:29:01,360 --> 00:29:03,440
Eleven thousand baht!

479
00:29:05,440 --> 00:29:07,280
-Amazing!
-Add it all up.

480
00:29:07,360 --> 00:29:08,680
Wow!

481
00:29:08,760 --> 00:29:11,440
Our total profit this month is

482
00:29:11,520 --> 00:29:16,160
215,620 baht.

483
00:29:19,320 --> 00:29:22,600
So if we make
just a little more next month,

484
00:29:22,680 --> 00:29:24,920
we'll have the full two million.

485
00:29:29,720 --> 00:29:32,000
But you still need to be careful, Auem.

486
00:29:32,680 --> 00:29:35,400
With the day we're supposed to get
Hom Thong back coming up,

487
00:29:35,480 --> 00:29:37,560
who knows what Sia Aun might try?

488
00:29:38,440 --> 00:29:40,280
We don't even know how Hom Thong's doing.

489
00:29:40,360 --> 00:29:41,680
And we can't sneak in to see him.

490
00:29:47,040 --> 00:29:48,840
Could you sign for the delivery?

491
00:29:53,280 --> 00:29:55,000
RECIPIENT

492
00:29:56,200 --> 00:29:58,480
-Your pen doesn't work.
-Oh.

493
00:29:58,560 --> 00:30:00,280
It's the only one I've got.

494
00:30:00,360 --> 00:30:03,160
Could you sign it
inside the office instead?

495
00:30:21,320 --> 00:30:25,680
UNCLE TIK

496
00:30:25,760 --> 00:30:27,160
UNCLE TIK

497
00:30:34,800 --> 00:30:35,840
Hom Thong is safe.

498
00:30:39,760 --> 00:30:40,720
-See?
-How do you know?

499
00:30:41,240 --> 00:30:44,880
I paid a deliveryman
to secretly take photos of Hom Thong

500
00:30:44,960 --> 00:30:47,520
while making a delivery to Sia Aun's farm.

501
00:30:48,120 --> 00:30:52,280
I was worried Sia Aun
might try something too.

502
00:30:53,880 --> 00:30:57,160
Wow! You're always one step ahead.

503
00:30:57,240 --> 00:30:58,160
Naturally.

504
00:30:58,880 --> 00:30:59,800
Alright.

505
00:30:59,880 --> 00:31:01,200
Hey, Auem.

506
00:31:01,280 --> 00:31:03,720
Have you set a date with Sia Aun
to get Hom Thong back?

507
00:31:05,400 --> 00:31:08,240
Probably toward the end of the month.

508
00:31:08,320 --> 00:31:09,360
Alright.

509
00:31:32,960 --> 00:31:34,120
-Boss.
-Huh?

510
00:31:34,720 --> 00:31:36,120
Auem called.

511
00:31:36,200 --> 00:31:39,040
She's coming to buy Hom Thong back
on the 25th of next month.

512
00:31:41,200 --> 00:31:43,320
When are we handing Hom Thong over?

513
00:31:43,400 --> 00:31:44,920
The 23rd.

514
00:31:47,040 --> 00:31:50,320
Then tell Auem we agree.

515
00:31:50,400 --> 00:31:53,160
She won't be getting
Hom Thong back anyway.

516
00:31:53,240 --> 00:31:54,120
Yes, Boss.

517
00:32:08,760 --> 00:32:10,680
BRING HOM THONG HOME - THE 3RD

518
00:32:10,760 --> 00:32:13,600
-Oh, just a minute!
-Here you go. Thank you.

519
00:32:13,680 --> 00:32:15,200
-Almost done!
-It's 100 baht for three.

520
00:32:15,280 --> 00:32:16,640
Want some?

521
00:32:17,480 --> 00:32:18,600
Okay, thank you.

522
00:32:19,800 --> 00:32:21,080
Oh, yes, we do!

523
00:32:21,160 --> 00:32:22,320
BRING HOM THONG HOME - THE 10TH

524
00:32:25,560 --> 00:32:27,160
Alright, all done.

525
00:32:27,240 --> 00:32:29,640
Thank you so much. Thank you.

526
00:32:41,680 --> 00:32:43,840
BRING HOM THONG HOME - THE 14TH

527
00:32:45,560 --> 00:32:47,960
-Look at this! Buffalo shampoo.
-What's this?

528
00:32:48,040 --> 00:32:50,120
It's made with a blend of floral extracts.

529
00:32:50,200 --> 00:32:52,840
It removes odors and relieves itching too.

530
00:33:12,600 --> 00:33:14,680
BRING HOM THONG HOME - THE 20TH

531
00:33:17,720 --> 00:33:21,280
Hom Ngern, I'm bringing
Hom Thong home today.

532
00:33:31,080 --> 00:33:32,760
Hello, Uncle Khwanchai.

533
00:33:33,280 --> 00:33:37,160
Please tell Sia Aun I'm bringing the money
to buy Hom Thong back today.

534
00:33:48,960 --> 00:33:51,040
CHOK CHAROENSUK FARM

535
00:33:54,120 --> 00:33:56,520
But it's only the 20th.

536
00:33:57,120 --> 00:33:58,920
Hom Thong's already in your pen.

537
00:33:59,000 --> 00:34:01,360
Auem can come get him
whenever she wants, can't she?

538
00:34:02,160 --> 00:34:05,720
I got the money together early,
so I wanted to get Hom Thong back sooner.

539
00:34:05,800 --> 00:34:09,560
So why don't we go inside
and get everything sorted out?

540
00:34:12,760 --> 00:34:14,159
Why so quiet?

541
00:34:15,320 --> 00:34:17,480
She's got the money, just like you agreed.

542
00:34:19,880 --> 00:34:21,520
Don't try anything, Sia Aun.

543
00:34:21,600 --> 00:34:23,920
I have a video of you

544
00:34:24,000 --> 00:34:27,600
promising to give Hom Thong back
if Auem raised two million baht.

545
00:34:29,639 --> 00:34:31,880
I'm not trying to pull a fast one
on any of you.

546
00:34:34,960 --> 00:34:38,159
I was all set to give Hom Thong back, but…

547
00:34:38,840 --> 00:34:40,360
But what?

548
00:34:41,400 --> 00:34:43,760
Hom Thong died this morning.

549
00:34:45,560 --> 00:34:46,639
What?

550
00:34:47,239 --> 00:34:50,000
How could he be dead?
What happened to him?

551
00:34:50,600 --> 00:34:52,239
He had hemorrhagic septicemia.

552
00:34:53,120 --> 00:34:55,920
I tried everything to save him,
but there was nothing I could do.

553
00:34:56,440 --> 00:34:59,000
No. You're lying!

554
00:34:59,080 --> 00:35:01,040
Why would I lie?

555
00:35:02,080 --> 00:35:04,360
He suddenly got worse
this morning and died.

556
00:35:05,720 --> 00:35:10,640
Khwanchai and my men
are burning Hom Thong's body right now.

557
00:35:11,440 --> 00:35:13,080
If you don't believe me,

558
00:35:13,160 --> 00:35:14,200
go see for yourself.

559
00:35:27,720 --> 00:35:29,920
Hey! Get some more firewood!

560
00:35:30,000 --> 00:35:32,520
Hurry up and burn it.
Then cover it with dirt.

561
00:35:32,600 --> 00:35:34,960
And get the livestock officials
to check the other buffaloes.

562
00:35:35,040 --> 00:35:36,280
Yes, Mr. Khwanchai.

563
00:35:36,360 --> 00:35:39,840
-Hey! Hom Thong!
-Hey, Ob!

564
00:35:39,920 --> 00:35:40,960
Calm down!

565
00:35:44,320 --> 00:35:45,720
Believe me now?

566
00:35:46,640 --> 00:35:48,200
Hom Thong is dead.

567
00:35:48,280 --> 00:35:49,360
I don't believe you.

568
00:35:49,440 --> 00:35:51,760
That could be some other buffalo's body.

569
00:35:51,840 --> 00:35:54,720
-Show them the vet's certificate.
-Yes, Boss.

570
00:36:03,320 --> 00:36:05,720
CHOK CHAROENSUK FARM
HOM THONG - HEMORRHAGIC SEPTICEMIA

571
00:36:11,320 --> 00:36:12,760
I don't believe a word you say.

572
00:36:13,360 --> 00:36:17,040
There's no proof that the buffalo
you're burning is Hom Thong.

573
00:36:17,920 --> 00:36:19,560
Where the hell are you hiding him?

574
00:36:20,160 --> 00:36:21,520
I'm not hiding him.

575
00:36:22,520 --> 00:36:25,720
Your buffalo is lying dead right here.

576
00:36:26,240 --> 00:36:28,040
Stop lying to us, Sia Aun.

577
00:36:28,120 --> 00:36:30,080
Tell us where Hom Thong is!

578
00:36:30,160 --> 00:36:33,240
If you don't believe me,
go look for him yourselves.

579
00:36:33,800 --> 00:36:36,720
See if Hom Thong's still alive on my farm.

580
00:36:56,720 --> 00:36:58,160
-Hom Thong!
-Hom Thong!

581
00:36:59,360 --> 00:37:00,440
Hom Thong!

582
00:37:01,640 --> 00:37:02,880
-Hom Thong!
-Hom Thong!

583
00:37:02,960 --> 00:37:05,040
-Hom Thong!
-Hom Thong!

584
00:37:05,120 --> 00:37:06,640
-Hom Thong!
-Where did he go?

585
00:37:07,920 --> 00:37:09,000
Hom Thong!

586
00:37:10,080 --> 00:37:11,040
Hom Thong!

587
00:37:13,760 --> 00:37:14,600
Auem!

588
00:37:15,640 --> 00:37:16,600
Hom Thong!

589
00:37:20,360 --> 00:37:21,520
Where did he go?

590
00:37:22,600 --> 00:37:24,000
-Hom Thong!
-Where are all the buffaloes?

591
00:37:24,080 --> 00:37:24,920
Hom Thong!

592
00:37:25,520 --> 00:37:26,920
Uncle, we can't find him.

593
00:37:38,120 --> 00:37:40,200
CHOK CHAROENSUK FARM

594
00:37:40,280 --> 00:37:42,560
I still don't believe Hom Thong is dead.

595
00:37:42,640 --> 00:37:44,480
Neither do I.

596
00:37:44,560 --> 00:37:46,040
Sia Aun wanted Hom Thong so badly.

597
00:37:46,120 --> 00:37:48,080
Would he really let him die that easily?

598
00:37:49,240 --> 00:37:52,080
Even though you arranged to get
Hom Thong back days early,

599
00:37:52,160 --> 00:37:53,960
Sia Aun still found a way
to screw us over.

600
00:37:55,960 --> 00:37:58,560
But he was so confident
about letting us search his farm.

601
00:37:58,640 --> 00:38:00,960
That means Hom Thong
definitely isn't here.

602
00:38:01,760 --> 00:38:05,400
But we have no idea
where he's hidden Hom Thong.

603
00:38:21,080 --> 00:38:22,200
Hello, Tong.

604
00:38:23,520 --> 00:38:24,720
I need to ask you something.

605
00:38:27,400 --> 00:38:30,120
I haven't seen Sia Aun's men
take Hom Thong anywhere.

606
00:38:30,200 --> 00:38:33,720
When I checked on him last week,
he was still in his pen.

607
00:38:34,760 --> 00:38:37,320
Did you notice anything strange
at Sia Aun's farm?

608
00:38:37,400 --> 00:38:38,800
Actually, the other day,

609
00:38:38,880 --> 00:38:42,040
they paid my shop to drop off some grass
in the rice field behind the farm.

610
00:38:42,760 --> 00:38:44,160
The rice field behind the farm?

611
00:38:45,400 --> 00:38:46,520
Thanks, Tong.

612
00:38:49,880 --> 00:38:51,600
Let's check
the rice field behind his farm.

613
00:38:51,680 --> 00:38:53,440
But that rice field

614
00:38:53,520 --> 00:38:55,040
covers several hectares, Uncle.

615
00:38:55,560 --> 00:38:57,240
How are we supposed to find Hom Thong?

616
00:39:00,040 --> 00:39:02,440
I know just who can help us find him.

617
00:40:41,040 --> 00:40:42,000
Subtitle translation by:
Chomchanach Yanaharn
